Here are three systems of equations. Find the solution to each system. $$\begin{cases} \ y = 3 x + 5 \\ \ y = - 2 x + 2 0 \end{cases}$$ $$\begin{cases} \ y = 2 x - 1 0 \\ \ y = 4 x - 1 \end{cases}$$ Match each graph to one of the systems of equations, then use the graphs to check that your solutions are reasonable.

